  "Follows the money from a finance dashboard and the full set of reports.": "Hufuatilia pesa kupitia dashibodi ya fedha na ripoti zote.",
  "System admin": "Msimamizi wa mfumo",
  "Approves or rejects new shops, manages users and sets platform settings.": "Huidhinisha au kukataa maduka mapya, husimamia watumiaji na kuweka mipangilio ya jukwaa.",
  "Register your shop": "Sajili duka lako",
  "Create an account and tell us about your shop.": "Fungua akaunti na utueleze kuhusu duka lako.",
  "Wait for approval": "Subiri idhini",
  "A system admin reviews your shop. You see its status while you wait.": "Msimamizi wa mfumo hukagua duka lako. Unaona hali yake wakati unasubiri.",
  "Set up": "Weka mipangilio",
  "Add products, suppliers, customers and your staff.": "Ongeza bidhaa, wasambazaji, wateja na wafanyakazi wako.",
  "Trade": "Fanya biashara",
  "Sell, buy and record expenses as the day goes.": "Uza, nunua na urekodi matumizi siku inavyoendelea.",
  "Read the reports": "Soma ripoti",
  "Check profit and loss, then export it as PDF, Excel or CSV.": "Angalia faida na hasara, kisha ihamishe kama PDF, Excel au CSV.",
  "Privacy": "Faragha",
  "We collect only what the app needs to work: your account details, your shop details, and the records you enter, such as sales, purchases, expenses, products, customers and staff.": "Tunakusanya tu kile ambacho programu inahitaji ili ifanye kazi: taarifa za akaunti yako, taarifa za duka lako, na rekodi unazoingiza, kama mauzo, manunuzi, matumizi, bidhaa, wateja na wafanyakazi.",
  "We do not sell your data.": "Hatuuzi data yako.",
  "The records of your shop are visible only to people you give access to, and to system admins who support the platform.": "Rekodi za duka lako zinaonekana tu kwa watu uliowapa ruhusa, na kwa wasimamizi wa mfumo wanaosaidia jukwaa.",
  "You can ask us to correct or delete your account data at any time.": "Unaweza kutuomba kusahihisha au kufuta data ya akaunti yako wakati wowote.",
  "Your data and security": "Data yako na usalama",
  "Each shop keeps its records separate from other shops. Access is controlled by role, and every person signs in with their own account.": "Kila duka huhifadhi rekodi zake kando na maduka mengine. Ufikiaji unadhibitiwa kwa jukumu, na kila mtu huingia kwa akaunti yake mwenyewe.",
  "Use a strong password and do not share it.": "Tumia nenosiri imara na usimpe mtu mwingine.",
  "Remove staff accounts when someone leaves.": "Futa akaunti za wafanyakazi mtu anapoondoka.",
  "Exports (PDF, Excel, CSV) are copies of your data. Keep them safe.": "Faili unazohamisha (PDF, Excel, CSV) ni nakala za data yako. Zihifadhi salama.",
  "Roles and access": "Majukumu na ufikiaji",
  "Shop admins decide who works in their shop and what role each person has. A role limits what someone can see and change. Only shop admins can edit or delete most records.": "Wasimamizi wa maduka huamua nani anafanya kazi katika duka lao na jukumu la kila mtu. Jukumu hupunguza kile mtu anachoweza kuona na kubadilisha. Wasimamizi wa maduka pekee ndio wanaoweza kuhariri au kufuta rekodi nyingi.",
  "Shop approval": "Idhini ya duka",
  "New shops are reviewed by a system admin before they can trade on the platform. We may reject or suspend a shop that gives false information or breaks these terms.": "Maduka mapya hukaguliwa na msimamizi wa mfumo kabla ya kuanza kufanya biashara kwenye jukwaa. Tunaweza kukataa au kusimamisha duka linalotoa taarifa za uongo au kukiuka masharti haya.",
  "Terms of use": "Masharti ya matumizi",
  "Use the app only for lawful business.": "Tumia programu kwa biashara halali pekee.",
  "You are responsible for the accuracy of the records you enter.": "Unawajibika kwa usahihi wa rekodi unazoingiza.",
  "Do not try to access the data of another shop or break the security of the app.": "Usijaribu kufikia data ya duka lingine au kuvunja usalama wa programu.",
  "We may update the app and these terms. We will publish changes on this page.": "Tunaweza kusasisha programu na masharti haya. Mabadiliko tutayachapisha kwenye ukurasa huu.",
