  "Sales, stock and money for every business you run.": "Mauzo, stoo na pesa kwa kila biashara unaloendesha.",
  "Sell at the till, record what you buy and spend, and see profit and loss by day, week, month or year. Your sellers, waiters, managers and accountants each get the screens they need and nothing more.": "Uza kaunta, rekodi unachonunua na kutumia, na uone faida na hasara kwa siku, wiki, mwezi au mwaka. Wauzaji, wahudumu, mameneja na wahasibu wako kila mmoja anapata skrini anazohitaji na si zaidi.",
