  "Done": "Imekamilika",
  "Everything a business does in a day, in one place.": "Kila kitu ambacho biashara hufanya kwa siku, mahali pamoja.",
  "From the first sale in the morning to the profit and loss report at night.": "Kuanzia mauzo ya kwanza asubuhi hadi ripoti ya faida na hasara usiku.",
  "Everyone sees the screens they need.": "Kila mtu anaona skrini anazohitaji.",
  "Access is set by role, so a waiter never ends up in the books and an accountant never ends up at the till.": "Ufikiaji hupangwa kwa jukumu, kwa hiyo mhudumu hafiki kwenye vitabu vya hesabu na mhasibu hafiki kaunta ya mauzo.",
  "From sign-up to first report.": "Kuanzia kujisajili hadi ripoti ya kwanza.",
  "Built for the people who actually run businesses.": "Imetengenezwa kwa watu wanaoendesha biashara kwa kweli.",
  ":app started with a simple question: why does a small business need three notebooks, a calculator and a spreadsheet to know whether it made money today?": ":app ilianza na swali rahisi: kwa nini biashara dogo linahitaji daftari tatu, kikokotoo na lahajedwali ili kujua kama lilipata faida leo?",
  "So we put selling, buying, spending and reporting in one app. Owners get a clear picture of every business. Staff get a short list of screens that match their job. Nobody has to learn accounting to use it.": "Kwa hiyo tuliweka kuuza, kununua, kutumia na kuripoti katika programu moja. Wamiliki wanapata picha wazi ya kila biashara. Wafanyakazi wanapata orodha fupi ya skrini zinazoendana na kazi yao. Hakuna anayehitaji kujifunza uhasibu ili aitumie.",
  "It works for a single counter, a restaurant with waiters, or an owner with several locations, because each business keeps its own records under one login.": "Inafaa kwa kaunta moja, mgahawa wenye wahudumu, au mmiliki mwenye maeneo kadhaa, kwa sababu kila biashara huhifadhi rekodi zake chini ya akaunti moja ya kuingia.",
  "Questions before you sign up?": "Una maswali kabla ya kujisajili?",
